# recipe-coverage map: every non-same-name reference outcome.
#
# /reference-package-recipes is the authoritative migration input,
# /recipes the authoritative native output. Same-name native recipes
# need no entry. Every other reference recipe needs exactly one entry:
#
#   <ref> rename <target>      # reason (one ref name, new native name)
#   <ref> consolidate <target> # reason (packaging split folded into one)
#   <ref> exempt               # reason (reviewed deliberate absence)
#
# Enforced by saphira-packager/tests/recipe-coverage.sh: unknown kinds
# fail, duplicate ref entries fail, entries for same-name pairs fail,
# missing targets fail, disabled targets fail, unlisted refs fail.
#
# Verified consolidations (evidence in the native recipe):
grub-bios consolidate grub # packaging split; monolith installs BIOS+EFI (replaces=grub-common grub-bios grub-efi)
grub-common consolidate grub # packaging split; see grub-bios
grub-efi consolidate grub # packaging split; see grub-bios
grub-doc consolidate grub # shipped as the grub-doc subpackage (subpackages="$pkgname-doc")
qemu-img consolidate qemu # one upstream tree (qemu-9.1.2 tools-only split); monolith full make install ships img+system+tools, no splits
qemu-system-x86_64 consolidate qemu # same upstream tree, x86_64-softmmu in the monolith build
qemu-tools consolidate qemu # same upstream tree, tools ship from the monolith build
python-certifi rename certifi # de-prefixed (replaces="python-certifi")
python-idna rename idna # de-prefixed (replaces="python-idna")
python-packaging rename packaging # de-prefixed (replaces="python-packaging")
python-pyparsing rename pyparsing # de-prefixed (replaces="python-pyparsing")
node22lts rename nodejs22 # side-by-side versioned runtime (binaries suffixed node22, headers in /usr/include/node22)
#
# Reviewed exemptions:
gcc-no-gcc-branch-cost exempt # deliberate obsolete per RECIPE_RULES.md toolchain guardrails; branch-cost lives in /recipes/gcc, never rebuild
#
# Notes (not entries; the test only reads entries):
# - freeradius-utils/ has no recipe.sh in reference (empty dir): nothing to migrate.
# - bind, age, saphira-mail have no native successor yet: gaps, not exemptions. They fail until ported.
